Final Data Persistence

After the FedEx data is consumed and processed by the Tracking Data Processor, the application internally calls the Tracking Resource Application through its POST API. The processed shipment information is then persisted in the shipment table.

Complete flow:

FedEx
→ Surround Edge Service
→ GCP Pub/Sub – ADVSHIP_TRACKING_FEDEX_SURROUND
→ TrackingWebhookFedexListener.receiveMessage()
→ TrackingFedexDTO
→ RetryableMessageProcessor / TrackingWebhookFedexPublisher
→ POST API call to Tracking Resource Application
→ Shipment data persisted in shipment table
→ Available for Beacon tracking/history

This is the final persistence point for the FedEx shipment data in the flow being discussed.